<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11.36px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Hi {!Receiving_User.FirstName},</span><br style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11.36px;"><br style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11.36px;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11.36px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Welcome to our Scoping Community!</span><br style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11.36px;"><br style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11.36px;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11.36px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">To get started, go to {!Community_Url}, logging in with Username: {!Receiving_User.Username} and the password you choose. Please be sure to write down your username and password for logging back in again.&nbsp;</span><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11.36px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br></span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11.36px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">If you forget your username and password at a later date, please email internalsf@atginfo.com requesting a link to establish a new password.</span><br style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11.36px;"><br style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11.36px;"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11.36px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Once you are in the community, navigate to the Assessment relevant to your needs and fill out the necessary sections. If you'd like to pause and return to the assessment at a later time, just don't forget to hit save.</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11.36px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br></span></div><div style=""><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 11.36px;">Once you have completed the assessment&nbsp;to the best of your abilities, with the assessment, check the</span></font></span></div><div style=""><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 11.36px;">"Finish Assessment" box on the final section of the questionnaire.</span></font></span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11.36px;"><br style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11.36px;"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11.36px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Thank you!</span><br style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11.36px;"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11.36px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">ATG Cognizant</span></div>]]></td>
</tr>
